# Bubbling Muck: "Until end of turn, whenever a player taps a Swamp for mana, that player adds an additional {B}." Two of
# them are two delayed triggered mana abilities (CR 603.7b, 605.1b), each adding its {B} at once (CR 605.4a): turn 5's
# Swamp makes {B}{B}{B} with the stack empty. Bayou, a Swamp Forest, tapped for {G} still adds {B}{B} (the land type
# counts, not the name or the mana it made - its rulings); a Forest adds only its {G}. The abilities end with the turn
# (CR 603.7b): on turn 7 the Swamp makes {B} alone.

